{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "783e5f8a-3f2b-8ead-8b91-1d12b67f209d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T14:11:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, my name is Yesenia Rivera. I need a replacement recycling bin. Mine got cracked right down the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, replacement recycling bin. Sure, we can look into that. What's the address for pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 39 Brewer Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-nine Brewer. Got it. And is the bin cracked, or did it go missing altogether?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cracked. The bottom's fine but the side split, and the driver told me he can't lift it anymore because it falls apart. It's the blue one with the lid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, blue one, cracked side. I'm writing that down. Are you the homeowner or renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The landlord doesn't deal with the bins, that's on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, renters can request them. Is there a good number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven four. Perfect. And sorry, I'm hearing a little echo, are you somewhere with a bad signal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I'm out in the garden shed. It's my office, basically. I got a desk and a heater in here. It's a little tin-y with the walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, makes sense. So I'll put in the request for a new recycling bin at 39 Brewer Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. One more thing. I'd like a supervisor to call me back, if that's possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is it about the bin, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the bin. I want somebody to tell me when it's coming and confirm it's not going to be a few weeks. I called once before and never heard back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that you want a supervisor callback about the bin delivery, at that same cell number. I can't say exactly when they'll get to it today, but I'll flag it so it goes to the front of their list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Is there anything I should do with the broken one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just leave it at the curb with the lid off on your regular day, or keep it by the new one until they swap. The supervisor can tell you which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Ms. Rivera. You have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
